  "title": "Special Rhubarb Cake",
  "description": "This rhubarb cake with butter sauce is made with buttermilk, studded with fresh rhubarb, and baked with a sugary topping for a delicious spring dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "amr81988"
  ],
